#: behaviour.cpp:57 rootopts.cpp:125
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "Allerande Opsies"

#: behaviour.cpp:73
msgid "&Open directories in separate windows"
msgstr "Open gidse in aparte vensters"

#: behaviour.cpp:74
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"directory, rather than showing that directory's contents in the current "
"window."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:81
msgid "&Show network operations in a single window"
msgstr "Vertoon netwerk operasies in 'n enkel venster"

#: behaviour.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Checking this option will group the progress information for all network "
"file transfers into a single window with a list. When the option is not "
"checked, all transfers appear in a separate window."
msgstr ""
"Toetsing hierdie opsie sal groep die vordering informasie vir alle netwerk "
"lêer oordragte binnein 'n enkel venster met 'n lys. Wanneer die opsie is "
"nie nagegaan, alle oordragte verskyn in 'n aparte venster."

#: behaviour.cpp:92
msgid "&Show file tips"
msgstr "Vertoon lêer leidrade"

#: behaviour.cpp:95
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see "
"a small popup window with additional information about that file"
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kontrole as, wanneer beweeg die muis bo 'n lêer, jy wil hê na "
"sien 'n klein opspring venster met aditionele informasie aangaande wat lêer"

#: behaviour.cpp:109
msgid "&Show previews in file tips"
msgstr "Vertoon voorskoue in lêer leidrade"

#: behaviour.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Here you can control if you want the popup window to contain a larger "
"preview for the file, when moving the mouse over it."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kontrole as jy wil hê die opspring venster na bevat 'n grootter "
"voorskou vir die lêer, wanneer beweeg die muis bo dit."

#: behaviour.cpp:117
msgid "Home &URL:"
msgstr "Huis Url:"

#: behaviour.cpp:122
msgid "Select Home Directory"
msgstr "Kies Huis Gids"

#: behaviour.cpp:127
msgid ""
"This is the URL (e.g. a directory or a web page) where Konqueror will jump "
"to when the \"Home\" button is pressed. This usually is your home dirctory, "
"symbolized by a 'tilde' (~)."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:134
msgid "Ask Confirmation For"
msgstr "Vra Bevestiging Vir"

#: behaviour.cpp:136
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"\"delete\" a file. "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Move To Trash:</em> moves the file to your trash directory, from "
"where it can be recovered very easily.</li> "
"<li><em>Delete:</em> simply deletes the file.</li> "
"<li><em>Shred:</em> not only deletes the file, but overwrites the area on "
"the disk where the file is stored, making recovery impossible. You should "
"not remove confirmation for this method unless you routinely work with very "
"confidential information.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie sê vir Konqueror hetsy na vra vir 'n bevestiging wanneer jy "
"\"uitvee\" 'n lêer. "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Beweeg na Gemors:</em>"
" skuiwe die lêer na jou Gemors gids, van waar dit kan wees herwin baie "
"maklik.</li> "
"<li><em>uitvee:</em> eenvoudig deletes die lêer.</li> "
"<li><em>Versnipper:</em>"
" nie slegs deletes die lêer, maar oorskryf die area op die disket waar die "
"lêer is gestoor, maak herwinning onmoontlik. jy moet nie verwyder "
"bevestiging vir Hierdie metode tensy jy op gereelde basis werk met baie "
"konfidentiële informasie.</li></ul>"

#: behaviour.cpp:148
msgid "Move to trash"
msgstr "Beweeg na gemors"

#: behaviour.cpp:152
msgid "Shred"
msgstr "Versnipper"

#: behaviour.cpp:157
msgid ""
"With this option activated, only one instance of Konqueror will exist in the "
"memory of your computer at any moment, no matter how many browsing windows "
"you open, thus reducing resource requirements."
"<p>Be aware that this also means that, if something goes wrong, all your "
"browsing windows will be closed simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Met hierdie opsie geaktiveer, slegs een voorbeeld van Konqueror sal bestaan "
"in die geheue van jou rekenaar na enige oomblik, nee geag hoe veel blaaiïng "
"vensters jy open, dus verminder hulpbron benodighede."
"<p>Wees bewus wat hierdie asook beteken wat, as iets gaan verkeerde, alle "
"jou blaaiïng vensters sal Wees gesluit gelyktydig."

#: behaviour.cpp:163
msgid ""
"With this option activated, only one instance of Konqueror will exist in the "
"memory of your computer at any moment, no matter how many local browsing "
"windows you open, thus reducing resource requirements."
"<p>Be aware that this also means that, if something goes wrong, all your "
"local browsing windows will be closed simultaneously"
msgstr ""
"Met hierdie opsie geaktiveer, slegs een voorbeeld van Konqueror sal bestaan "
"in die geheue van jou rekenaar na enige oomblik, nee geag hoe veel plaaslike "
"blaaiïng vensters jy open, dus verminder hulpbron benodighede."
"<p>Wees bewus wat hierdie asook beteken wat, as iets gaan verkeerde, alle "
"jou plaaslike blaaiïng vensters sal Wees gesluit gelyktydig"

#: behaviour.cpp:169
msgid ""
"With this option activated, only one instance of Konqueror will exist in the "
"memory of your computer at any moment, no matter how many web browsing "
"windows you open, thus reducing resource requirements."
"<p>"
"Be aware that this also means that, if something goes wrong, all your web "
"browsing windows will be closed simultaneously"
msgstr ""
"Met hierdie opsie geaktiveer, slegs een voorbeeld van Konqueror sal bestaan "
"in die geheue van jou rekenaar na enige oomblik, nee geag hoe veel web "
"blaaiïng vensters jy open, dus verminder hulpbron benodighede."
"<p>Wees bewus wat hierdie asook beteken wat, as iets gaan verkeerde, alle "
"jou web blaaiïng vensters sal Wees gesluit gelyktydig"

#: behaviour.cpp:176
msgid "Minimize Memory Usage"
msgstr "Minimeer Geheue Gebruik"

#: behaviour.cpp:180
msgid "&Never"
msgstr "Moet nooit"

#: behaviour.cpp:181
msgid ""
"Disables the minimization of memory usage and allows you to make each "
"browsing activity independent from the others"
msgstr ""
"Deaktiveer die minimisering van geheue gebruik en laat toe jy na maak elke "
"blaaiïng aktiwiteit onafhanklike van die andere"

#: behaviour.cpp:184
msgid "For &local browsing only (recommended)"
msgstr "Vir plaaslike blaaiïng slegs (aanbeveel)"

#: behaviour.cpp:187
msgid "For &Web browsing only"
msgstr "Vir Web blaaiïng slegs"

#: behaviour.cpp:190
msgid "Alwa&ys (use with care)"
msgstr "Altyd (gebruik met versigtigheid)"

#: behaviour.cpp:342
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Behavior</h1> You can configure how Konqueror behaves as a "
"file manager here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Gedrag</h1> Jy kan konfigureer hoe Konqueror gedrag as 'n "
"lêer bestuurder hier."

#: browser.cpp:109
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "Voorkoms"

#: browser.cpp:110
msgid "&Behavior"
msgstr "Gedrag"

#: browser.cpp:111
msgid "&Previews"
msgstr "Voorskoue"

#: browser.cpp:113
msgid "&Quick Copy && Move"
msgstr "Vinnige Kopie && Beweeg"

#: desktop.cpp:66
msgid "N&umber of desktops: "
msgstr "Nommer van werkskerms: "

#: desktop.cpp:71
msgid ""
"Here you can set how many virtual desktops you want on your KDE desktop. "
"Move the slider to change the value."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel hoe veel virtuele werkskerms jy wil hê op jou Kde "
"werkskerm. Beweeg die skuiwer na verander die waarde."

#: desktop.cpp:81
msgid "Desktop &Names"
msgstr "Werkskerm Name"

#: desktop.cpp:87 desktop.cpp:89
msgid "Desktop %1:"
msgstr "Werkskerm %1:"

#: desktop.cpp:91 desktop.cpp:92 desktop.cpp:93 desktop.cpp:94
#, c-format
msgid "Here you can enter the name for desktop %1"
msgstr "Hier jy kan invoer die naam vir werkskerm %1"

#: desktop.cpp:165 desktop.cpp:183
#, c-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "Werkskerm %1"

#: desktop.cpp:174
msgid ""
"<h1>Desktop Number & Names</h1>In this module, you can configure how many "
"virtual desktops you want and how these should be labelled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Werkskerm Nommer & Name</h1>In hierdie module, jy kan konfigureer hoe "
"veel virtuele werkskerms jy wil hê en hoe hierdie moet wees geëtiketeer."

#: fontopts.cpp:60
msgid "&Standard font:"
msgstr "Standaard skrif tipe:"

#: fontopts.cpp:64
msgid "This is the font used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Hierdie is die skrif tipe gebruik word na vertoon teks in Konqueror vensters."

#: fontopts.cpp:75
msgid "Font si&ze:"
msgstr "Skrif tipe grootte:"

#: fontopts.cpp:83
msgid "This is the font size used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die skrif tipe grootte gebruik word na vertoon teks in Konqueror "
"vensters."

#: fontopts.cpp:91
msgid "Normal te&xt color:"
msgstr "Normale teks kleur:"

#: fontopts.cpp:95
msgid "This is the color used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Hierdie is die kleur gebruik word na vertoon teks in Konqueror vensters."

#: fontopts.cpp:122
msgid "&Text background color:"
msgstr "Teks agtergrond kleur:"

#: fontopts.cpp:130
msgid "This is the color used behind the text for the icons on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die kleur gebruik word agter die teks vir die ikoone op die "
"werkskerm."

#: fontopts.cpp:141
msgid "&Word-wrap icon text"
msgstr "Word-wrap ikoon teks"

#: fontopts.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Checking this option will wrap long filenames to multiple lines, rather than "
"showing only the part of the filename that fits on a single line."
"<p> Hint: if you uncheck this option, you can still see the word-wrapped "
"filename by pausing the mouse pointer over the icon."
msgstr ""
"Toetsing hierdie opsie sal oorvloei lang lêername na veelvuldige lyne, "
"eerder as te wys slegs die deel van die lêernaam wat pas op 'n enkel "
"lyn."
"<p> Leidraad: as jy ontkies hierdie opsie, jy kan nogsteeds sien die "
"word-wrapped lêernaam deur pouseer die muis wyser bo die ikoon."

#: fontopts.cpp:154
msgid "&Underline filenames"
msgstr "Onderstreep lêername"

#: fontopts.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in filenames being underlined, so that they "
"look like links on a web page. Note: to complete the analogy, make sure that "
"single click activation is enabled in the mouse control module."
msgstr ""
"Toetsing hierdie opsie sal resultaat in lêername te wees geonderstreep, "
"sodat wat hulle kyk hou van skakel op 'n web bladsy. Nota: na volledige die "
"analogie, maak seker wat enkel kliek aktivering is geaktiveer in die muis "
"kontrole module."

#: fontopts.cpp:167
msgid "Display file sizes in b&ytes"
msgstr "Vertoon lêer grotes in grepe"

#: fontopts.cpp:171
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in file sizes being displayed in bytes. "
"Otherwise file sizes are being displayed in kilobytes or megabytes if "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Toetsing hierdie opsie sal resultaat in lêer grotes te wees vertoon in "
"grepe. Andersins lêer grotes word te wees vertoon in kilogrepe of megagrepe "
"as geskikte."

#: fontopts.cpp:361
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Appearance</h1> You can configure how Konqueror looks as a "
"file manager here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Voorkoms</h1>"
" Jy kan konfigureer hoe Konqueror kyk as 'n lêer bestuurder hier."

#: previews.cpp:49
msgid "Allow previews and \"Folder Icons Reflect Contents\" on protocols:"
msgstr "Toelaat voorskoue en \"Kabinet Ikoone Reflekteer Inhoud\" op protokolle:"

#: previews.cpp:80
msgid ""
"This option makes it possible to choose when the file previews and smart "
"folder icons in the File Manager should be activated.\n"
"In the list of protocols that appear, select which ones are fast enough for "
"you to allow previews to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie maak dit moontlik na kies wanneer die lêer voorskoue en "
"luukse kabinet ikoone In die lêer Bestuurder moet wees geaktiveer.\n"
"In die lys van protokolle wat verskyn, kies wat ene word vinnige genoeg vir "
"jy na toelaat voorskoue na wees gegenereer."

#: previews.cpp:85
msgid "Maximum file size:"
msgstr "Maksimum lêer grootte:"

#: previews.cpp:88
msgid " MB"
msgstr "  mb "

#: previews.cpp:94
msgid "Increase size of previews relative to icons"
msgstr "Vermeerder grootte van voorskoue relatiewe na ikoone"

#: previews.cpp:97
msgid "Use thumbnails embedded in files"
msgstr "Gebruik duimnaelskets ingebedde in lêers"

#: previews.cpp:101
msgid ""
"Select this to use thumbnails that are found inside some file types (e.g. "
"JPEG). This will increase speed and reduce disk usage. Deselect it if you "
"have files that have been processed by programs which create inaccurate "
"thumbnails, such as ImageMagick."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie na gebruik duimnaelskets wat word gevind binne in sommige lêer "
"tipes (e.g. Jpeg). hierdie sal vermeerder spoed en verminder disket gebruik. "
"Ontkies dit as jy het lêers wat het al geprosesseer deur programme wat skep "
"onakuraat duimnaelskets, soos as Imagemagick."

#: previews.cpp:164
msgid ""
"<h1>Preview Options</h1> Here you can modify the behavior of Konqueror when "
"it shows the files in a directory."
"<h2>The list of protocols:</h2> check the protocols over which previews "
"should be shown, uncheck those over which they shouldn't. For instance, you "
"might want to show previews over SMB if the local network is fast enough, "
"but you might disable it for FTP if you often visit very slow FTP sites with "
"large images."
"<h2>Maximum File Size:</h2> select the maximum file size for which previews "
"should be generated. For instance, if set to 1 MB (the default), no preview "
"will be generated for files bigger than 1 MB, for speed reasons."
msgstr ""

#: rootopts.cpp:68
msgid "Sound Files"
msgstr "Klank Lêers"

#: rootopts.cpp:136
msgid "Enable desktop &menu"
msgstr "Aktiveer werkskerm kieslys"

#: rootopts.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the desktop popup menus to appear at the top "
"of the screen in the style of Macintosh. This setting is independent of the "
"global top-level menu setting that applies to KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die werkskerm opspring kieslyste na "
"verskyn na die bo van die skerm in die styl van Macintosh. hierdie opset is "
"onafhanklike van die globale bo-level kieslys opset wat van toepassing is na "
"Kde programme."

#: rootopts.cpp:143
msgid "E&nable icons on desktop"
msgstr "Aktiveer ikoone op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ontkies hierdie opsie as jy doen nie wil hê na het ikoone op die werkskerm. "
"Sonder om te ikoone die werkskerm sal wees ietwat vinniger maar jy sal nee "
"langer wees in staat na trek lêers na die werkskerm."

#: rootopts.cpp:150
msgid "&Show hidden files on desktop"
msgstr "Vertoon weg gesteekte lêers op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:152
msgid ""
"If you check this option, any files in your desktop directory that begin "
"with a period (.) will be shown. Usually, such files contain configuration "
"information, and remain hidden from view."
"<p> For example, files which are named \".directory\" are plain text files "
"which contain information for Konqueror, such as the icon to use in "
"displaying a directory, the order in which files should be sorted, etc. You "
"should not change or delete these files unless you know what you are doing!"
msgstr ""
"as jy bevestig hierdie opsie, enige lêers in jou werkskerm gids wat begin "
"met 'n periode (.) sal wees vertoon. Gewoonlik, soos lêers bevat opstelling "
"informasie, en bly weg gesteekte van besigtig."
"<p> Vir voorbeeld, lêers wat word genaamd \".gids\" word eenvoudig teks "
"lêers wat bevat informasie Vir Konqueror, soos as die ikoon na gebruik in "
"vertooning 'n gids, die volgorde in wat lêers moet wees gesorteer, etc. jy "
"moet nie verander of uitvee hierdie lêers tensy jy ken wat jy word doen!"

#: rootopts.cpp:162
msgid "Pro&grams in desktop window"
msgstr "Programme in werkskerm venster"

#: rootopts.cpp:164
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê na hardloop X11 programme wat teken "
"binnein die werkskerm soos as xsneeu, xpikkewyn of xberg. as jy het probleme "
"met programme hou van netscape wat Bevestig die root venster vir wat loop "
"instansies, deaktiveer hierdie opsie."

#: rootopts.cpp:171
msgid "Show Previews For"
msgstr "Vertoon Voorskoue Vir"

#: rootopts.cpp:172
msgid "Select for which types of files you want to enable preview images"
msgstr "Kies vir wat tipes van lêers jy wil hê na aktiveer voorskou beelde"

#: rootopts.cpp:178
msgid "Clicks on Desktop"
msgstr "Klieke op Werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:183
msgid "&Left button:"
msgstr "Links knoppie:"

#: rootopts.cpp:184
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat gebeur wanneer Jy kliek die links knoppie van jou aanwys "
"toestel op die werkskerm:"

#: rootopts.cpp:187
msgid "Right b&utton:"
msgstr "Regterkant knoppie:"

#: rootopts.cpp:188
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat gebeur wanneer Jy kliek die regterkant knoppie van jou "
"aanwys toestel op die werkskerm:"

#: rootopts.cpp:199 rootopts.cpp:224
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "Redigeer..."

#: rootopts.cpp:206 rootopts.cpp:257
msgid ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that "
"desktop, or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching "
"desktops if necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or "
"minimized windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among "
"other things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the "
"screen, and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful "
"for quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known "
"as \"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Nee aksie:</em> as jy dalk skat, niks gebeur!</li> "
"<li><em>Venster lys kieslys:</em> 'n kieslys te wys alle vensters op alle "
"virtuele werkskerms spring begin. jy kan kliek op die werkskerm naam na "
"wissel na wat werkskerm, van op 'n Venster naam na verskuiwende fokus na wat "
"Venster, omskakeling werkskerms as nodige, en herstel die Venster as dit is "
"weg gesteekte. weg gesteekte van geminimeer vensters word verteenwoordig met "
"hulle name in aanhalingstekens.</li> "
"<li><em>werkskerm kieslys:</em> 'n konteks kieslys vir die werkskerm spring "
"begin. Onder ander dinge, hierdie kieslys het opsies vir konfigurering van "
"die vertoon, sluit van die skerm, en afteken uit van Kde.</li> "
"<li><em>Aansoek kieslys:</em> die \"K\" kieslys spring begin. hierdie dalk "
"wees bruikbare vir vinnig toegang te kry tot programme as jy hou van na hou "
"die paneel (asook bekend as \"Kicker\") weg gesteekte van besigtig.</li></ul>"

#: rootopts.cpp:222
msgid "Middle &button:"
msgstr "Middelste knoppie:"

#: rootopts.cpp:230
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your "
"pointing device on the desktop: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that "
"desktop, or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching "
"desktops if necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or "
"minimized windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among "
"other things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the "
"screen, and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful "
"for quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known "
"as \"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat gebeur wanneer Jy kliek die middelste knoppie van jou aanwys "
"toestel op die werkskerm: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Nee aksie:</em> as Jy dalk skat, niks gebeur!</li> "
"<li><em>Venster lys kieslys:</em> 'n kieslys te wys alle vensters op alle "
"virtuele werkskerms spring begin. Jy kan kliek op die werkskerm naam na "
"wissel na wat werkskerm, van op 'n Venster naam na verskuiwende fokus na wat "
"Venster, omskakeling werkskerms as nodige, en herstel die Venster as dit is "
"weg gesteekte. weg gesteekte van geminimeer vensters word verteenwoordig met "
"hulle name in aanhalingstekens.</li> "
"<li><em>werkskerm kieslys:</em> 'n konteks kieslys vir die werkskerm spring "
"begin. Onder ander dinge, hierdie kieslys het opsies vir konfigurering van "
"die vertoon, sluit van die skerm, en afteken uit van Kde.</li> "
"<li><em>Aansoek kieslys:</em> die \"K\" kieslys spring begin. hierdie dalk "
"wees bruikbare vir vinnig toegang te kry tot programme as Jy hou van na hou "
"die paneel (asook bekend as \"Kicker\") weg gesteekte van besigtig.</li></ul>"

#: rootopts.cpp:250
msgid "Edi&t..."
msgstr "Redigeer..."

#: rootopts.cpp:291
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Toestelle"

#: rootopts.cpp:294
msgid "Displa&y devices on desktop"
msgstr "Vertoon toestelle op werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:299
msgid "Types to Display"
msgstr "Tipes na Vertoon"

#: rootopts.cpp:300
msgid "Deselect the device types which you do not want to see on the desktop"
msgstr "Ontkies die toestel tipes wat jy doen nie wil hê na sien op die werkskerm"

