msgid "Custom Menu 2"
msgstr "Pasmaak Kieslys 2"

#: rootopts.cpp:530
msgid ""
"<h1>Desktop</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose various options\n"
"for your desktop, including the way in which icons are arranged and\n"
"the pop-up menus associated with clicks of the middle and right mouse\n"
"buttons on the desktop.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Werkskerm</h1>\n"
"Hierdie module laat toe jy na kies verskeie opsies\n"
"vir jou Werkskerm, insluitend die weg in wat ikoone word gerangskik en\n"
"die pop-up kieslyste geassosieer met klieke van die middelste en regterkant "
"muis\n"
"knoppies op die Werkskerm.\n"
"Gebruik die \"Wat is Hierdie?\" (Verskuiwende+F1) na kry hulp op spesifieke "
"opsies."

#: rootopts.cpp:559
msgid "Des&ktop path:"
msgstr "Werkskerm gids soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:566
msgid ""
"This directory contains all the files which you see on your desktop. You can "
"change the location of this directory if you want to, and the contents will "
"move automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids bevat alle die lêers wat jy sien op jou werkskerm. jy kan "
"verander die ligging van Hierdie gids as jy wil hê na, en die inhoud sal "
"beweeg automaties na die nuwe ligging as goed."

#: rootopts.cpp:572
msgid "&Trash path:"
msgstr "Gemors gids soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:579
msgid ""
"This directory contains deleted files (until you empty the trashcan). You "
"can change the location of this directory if you want to, and the contents "
"will move automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids bevat uitgevee lêers (totdat jy leeg die asblik). jy kan "
"verander die ligging van Hierdie gids as jy wil hê na, en die inhoud sal "
"beweeg automaties na die nuwe ligging as goed."

#: rootopts.cpp:587
msgid "A&utostart path:"
msgstr "Outomatiese begin gids soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:594
msgid ""
"This directory contains applications or links to applications (shortcuts) "
"that you want to have started automatically whenever KDE starts. You can "
"change the location of this directory if you want to, and the contents will "
"move automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids bevat programme van skakel na programme (kortpaaie) wat jy wil "
"hê na het beginne automaties wanneer ook al Kde beginne. jy kan verander "
"die ligging van Hierdie gids as jy wil hê na, en die inhoud sal beweeg "
"automaties na die nuwe ligging as goed."

#: rootopts.cpp:603
msgid "D&ocuments path:"
msgstr "Dokumente gids soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:610
msgid "This directory will be used by default to load or save documents from or to."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids sal wees gebruik word deur verstek na las of stoor dokumente "
"van of na."

#: rootopts.cpp:635 rootopts.cpp:698 rootopts.cpp:737
msgid "Trash"
msgstr "Gemors"

#: rootopts.cpp:722 rootopts.cpp:749
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "Outomatiese begin"

#: rootopts.cpp:726
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:796
msgid ""
"The path for '%1' has been changed.\n"
"Do you want me to move the files from '%2' to '%3'?"
msgstr ""
"Die gids soeklys vir '%1' het al het verander.\n"
"Doen jy wil hê my na beweeg Die lêers van '%2' na '%3'?"

#: rootopts.cpp:797
msgid "Confirmation required"
msgstr "Bevestiging benodig"

#: rootopts.cpp:831
msgid ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose where in the filesystem the files on your "
"desktop should be stored.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"Hierdie module laat toe jy na kies waar in die lêersisteem die lêers op "
"jou werkskerm moet wees gestoor.\n"
"Gebruik die \"Wat is Hierdie?\" (Verskuiwende+F1) na kry hulp op spesifieke "
"opsies."
